  "prompt": "For each promotion, how many products does it cover, and how many units were sold with that promotion? A promotion covers the products it lists, and a unit is sold with a promotion when its order line carries that promotion's promo_id. Return three columns, in this order: promo_id, n_products and units. Return one row for each promotion that covers at least one product and has at least one line sold with it. Any row order is fine.",
